{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣女星王凱蒂早年曾演出過王力宏《你不在》的MV女主角，也參演過電影《夏日的麼麼茶》、電視劇《惡魔在身邊》等。</p><p>近年她結婚生仔後就淡出演藝圈，台媒近日直擊她帶着兩個孩子坐巴士，細心地剝橙給一對子女吃，享受平凡天倫樂。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&amp;l</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T20:26:52.120674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T20:01:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T20:20:10.542860+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T20:20:10.542860+00:00","content_hash":"8e9c8fa0606752404b045c3d84264f4c7d76076260710bc97c52f0b2ebc43be2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}